English summary:

This project is a TerraFirmaCraft (TFC) 1.20.x addon / porting project. Some
parts are copied from, adapted from, or structurally derived from TFC 1.20.x /
1.21.x. This project uses path-based mixed licensing; see LICENSE-MAP.md.

  - TFC-derived code is licensed under EUPL v1.2, or a later version where
    permitted.

  - TFC-derived art, models, textures, sounds, and data-pack JSON are licensed
    under CC BY-SA 4.0.

  - Author-original code, compatibility implementation, runtime logic,
    configuration, own data, and own resources are All Rights Reserved unless
    separately licensed in writing. Without separate written permission,
    redistributors may not copy, mirror, re-upload, preinstall, bundle, sell,
    rebrand, impersonate an official release, or use the author-reserved
    portions for AI training. They may not include the author-reserved portions
    or source/builds containing them in modpacks, server bundles, mirror sites,
    membership resources, ad/sponsor-monetized releases, or similar packaged
    distribution scenarios. Redistributors who only want to use the EUPL /
    CC BY-SA portions must remove the author-reserved portions and comply with
    the applicable upstream licenses.

  - Third-party upstream components remain governed by their original licenses;
    see NOTICE for attribution.


